  "checkpoint": "MSC-122 account lifecycle, location and optional API business summaries",
  "date": "2026-10-11",
  "status": "Qualified on KVM Helm 142 and monolith; original dev environment restored; KVM stopped",
  "changes": [
    "AccountLifecycleService owns the existing logout audit and deletion initiation. HomeUserProfileService delegates; Facebook deletion calls the same owner directly. Status save, durable work, purge counter, cache invalidation, audit and telemetry retain their original order. Existing cache eviction remains once per public deletion operation.",
    "AccountLocationService owns the existing location update, region eligibility and stored-partition rules. The account/selected-profile path retains one country lookup and targeted location writes. The full profile-load wrapper retains demo-selector eviction after its response, and full MyScoutee seed-country behavior is preserved.",
    "ProfileStatusValues shares the exact existing persisted status interpretation. Persisted account fields and document schemas are unchanged.",
    "IntegrationSettingsService consumes optional IntegrationAccountSummaries. Native and remote Affiliates implement that existing-operation contract; full member settings retain summary and participant calls in order, administrator settings still skip them, and owner failures propagate.",
    "Read-only runtime probes add region eligibility, invalid-coordinate rejection and administrator API settings allow/deny checks. General member API settings are not probed because their installed affiliate summary may create a link."
  ],
